      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The VRC flavor of yt-dlp is already modified/patched to remove a lot of the options, right?\n\nMay be worth throwing in an additional patch with something from this: https://docs.python.org/3/library/warnings.html\n\ne.g.\n\n```\n\n    import warnings\n\n    warnings.simplefilter(\"ignore\")\n\n```",
